# Delta

!!#T#Math# ++GL!)Delta++ is a math workspace in the ribbon style, or in its original Delta Classic look. It has a live graphing calculator, a LaTeX renderer and a calculator!

[Open Delta](/delta) · [Phone version](/delta/mobile/)

| Tab | Use it for |
| --- | --- |
| @gem-5@Graph@ | Plot equations as you type. Add ++GL!)sliders++ for values you want to change, use ++GL!)lists++, and draw ++GL!)polygons++ |
| @gem-5@LaTeX@ | Write LaTeX and see it drawn, ready to copy into a document |
| @gem-5@Calculator@ | Everyday and scientific calculations |
| @gem-5@Share@ | Share & Chat, for working on a graph together |

::tip Math in documents
Writeout, Bitbook and OpenDB draw math from `$x^2$` and `$$ ... $$`, using KaTeX. Delta's LaTeX tab is a good place to try an equation before pasting it!
::end
